{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0333_1000_p", "source_sha256": "17708bfa075d8fad99e9814e941614810a3123df08d5b34c53ef8b3d632e00b1", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の今日の撮影テーマは\n『大人デート』。さて、あずささんはどこに……）", "zh": "（今天写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄主题是\n“成人约会”。那么，阿梓小姐在哪里呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0333_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "c81ae84948e6f96999185b97368061a96a890690e22cf7327dc24783aeb25489", "ja": "どんな風にするのがいいのかしら……\nあっ、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "该怎么做才好呢……\n啊，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0333_1002_p", "source_sha256": "83d1389e2f5ad6686e0246a840b647d8ce412946b655a5c722f8185743591d73", "ja": "あずささん。ここにいたんですね……あれ？\n何か困ってましたか？", "zh": "あずさ小姐。原来您在这里啊……咦？\n是遇到什么麻烦了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0333_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "27e670445b2e351322d308da237740e91a898e82242df089553c4b548e084062", "ja": "あ、いえ、こんなにかわいいワンピースが\n着られるなんてって、嬉しく思っていました♪", "zh": "啊，不是的，我只是觉得竟然能穿上这么可爱的连衣裙，感到很开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0333_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "326f2b1e29dc3d763e28f1202edf8892305f214ff7a3b923dd96f787dd7cd538", "ja": "ただ、少し……撮影テーマが、\n私にはハードルが高い気もして……。", "zh": "不过，只是觉得……这次的拍摄主题，对我来说好像有点难度太高了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0333_1005_p", "source_sha256": "354061b50b74fe100ec87205ca3b21803d291a26ebbb5fb272d0460ffb63055f", "ja": "えっ、そうなんですか？\nもうちょっと詳しく聞かせてください。", "zh": "咦，是这样吗？\n能再详细跟我说说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0333_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "0e16e395c0f1d5b36c39321d7ea53b44d1692bcb6cc75dd13d1a307747992c85", "ja": "ええと、今日のテーマは『大人デート』ですから、\nキリッとしなきゃですよね。それが少し心配で……。", "zh": "那个，今天的主题是“大人约会”，\n所以得表现得干练一点，对吧。我有点担心自己做不到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0333_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4ad47e4b40bad595c03c9b56bb0743081c2d225752afd8da61f3531f70c77c79", "ja": "なるほど。そんなイメージもあるかもしれませんね。\nけど、リラックスした場面もあっていいのでは？", "zh": "原来如此。或许确实会给人这样的印象。\n不过，偶尔也可以有放松的时候吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0333_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "4bcf3780a46ebe01c4be568c736ea239b3f44f2570ad98bc139bc7d3ca55df74", "ja": "えっ、リラックス？　……あ。好きな人との\nデートですものね。きっと自然に肩の力も抜けて……。", "zh": "咦，放松？……啊。毕竟是和喜欢的人约会嘛。肩膀上的力气肯定也会自然而然地放松下来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0333_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "6739540def5710fcf86a50cf3a55b996c22ff6df378754384ef54210ff772791", "ja": "そのまま綺麗な夜景までエスコートなんてしてもらえ\nたら……とても幸せな気分になれそうです。", "zh": "要是还能被带去欣赏美丽的夜景……感觉一定会幸福得不得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0333_1010_p", "source_sha256": "10f0ffd4682664d3a70db7fdb9a65b0cb4e5503578582df2f3517e8a15bd72b2", "ja": "いいですね！　今の表情、とても幸せそうですよ。\nそんなあずささんの姿を撮ってもらいましょう！", "zh": "太棒了！你刚才的表情，看起来非常幸福哦。\n就让摄影师拍下梓小姐这样的神情吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0333_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "ec8accd47d4449c0ceb657a4c31284f8682bd2d98f8ca7c7a4ea066652d03405", "ja": "うふふ、キリッとしていなくても、ふたりでゆったりと\nした時間を……。とびきりの『大人デート』ですよね。", "zh": "呵呵，就算没有那么端庄严肃，两个人悠闲度过的时光……也是最棒的“大人约会”了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0333_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "760386d17b1ecd0a8b342364c7825adac3a417c1729428962625d7a2115665f1", "ja": "このワンピースも、かわいらしいのにロマンチックで、\n雰囲気を盛り上げてくれそう……♪", "zh": "这件连衣裙既可爱又浪漫，感觉能让气氛更加高涨……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0333_1013_p", "source_sha256": "010d767ce5ca4c9ee1fc9d7317db1e9c84c880d74afcfc15bb8d427e84ae7405", "ja": "ええ、あずささんらしい、素敵な写真になりそうです。\nイメージ、つかめたみたいですね！", "zh": "嗯，这样一来，应该会成为很有梓小姐风格的精彩照片。\n看来你已经抓住感觉了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0333_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "010989ff808883c8882412a4aa296e81ad90e8b55ad75fb22a6786d721067d96", "ja": "はい。{$P$}さんのおかげで、\nなんとかなりそうな気がしてきました♪", "zh": "是的。多亏了{$P$}先生，感觉应该能顺利完成了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0333_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "65e358c13c4ce2e5a3c596b4552bc41acd7f63ab36a56fdbf10fc90bd7b77c5a", "ja": "あ、でも……まだちょっとだけ心配なので、\nよかったら予行演習に付き合ってもらえませんか？", "zh": "啊，不过……我还是有点担心，所以如果可以的话，能陪我做一下预演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0333_1016_p", "source_sha256": "641352bc106459aebd9883cb8f573ccd9273c2ba4dcd7526b1fe7930da2d26e4", "ja": "はい、もちろん！　撮影が始まるまでの間、\n一緒に練習しましょう！", "zh": "好的，当然没问题！在拍摄开始前，\n我们一起练习吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0333_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "bc252a086054352278b5c8298872bcc8d3f2aabc840bc632b93b6d22fcf8cf62", "ja": "ありがとうございます～。とても心強いです。\nじゃあちょっとだけ、お願いしますね♪", "zh": "谢谢你～有你在真让人安心。\n那就拜托你陪我练习一会儿啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
